0 Footfall — one-motor twelve-link leg-path tracer
0 Name: footfall.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE Redistributable under the BSD-3-Clause license; see ../LICENSE.
0 // Original rounded linkage, remote frame, program and lessons by CrispStrobe.
0 // Base and motor-cradle pattern adapted from Brickwright Lite Quickstroke (BSD-3-Clause).
0 // One SPIKE angular motor on hub port A. Saved unwrapped encoder datum A=0 degrees.
0 // Program route: 0 -> 90 -> 180 -> 270 -> 360 -> 0 degrees.
0 // Manual/analytical envelope: -5 to 365 degrees; software bounds are not physical stops.
0 // Link spans LDU: crank 60; b/c/d/f/g 160; e/k 240; h 280; i/j 200.
0 // Fixed world joints X/Z: O=(0,0), P=(160,40). All joint axes are parallel to +Y.
0 // Measure foot G at lower_triangle_h_FG local point (0,0,140).
0 // Measure chassis P at frame_top_X_AP local point (0,0,140).
0 // External standard LDraw meshes are referenced, not embedded. Connect motor cable to hub A.
